# --- Grim Dawn Build Calculator ---
# Rule of thumb: if the SPA doesn't load it at runtime, it doesn't belong here.

node_modules/
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# The datamine workspace lives as a SIBLING (../_gd_extract) and is NEVER committed
# here — build-data.mjs reads it by relative path at build time and copies only the
# shipped subset (data.js + the icons actually used) into the repo. If it's ever
# nested, ignore it:
# _*_extract/

# raw / intermediate data that is not the shipped subset
data/_raw/
assets/_full_export/

# NOTE: data.js IS committed on purpose — GitHub Pages serves it directly.
# assets/ (the copied item sprites + paperdoll art) IS committed — the SPA loads it.
